WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.013 --> 00:00:01.180
from.

00:00:01.313 --> 00:00:03.248
&gt;&gt; Thank you to Fred there.

00:00:03.382 --> 00:00:04.750
You told us that it was going to

00:00:04.883 --> 00:00:06.685
happen and that is exactly what

00:00:06.819 --> 00:00:07.853
happened in the speech.

00:00:07.953 --> 00:00:09.355
President Putin not backing down

00:00:09.488 --> 00:00:11.056
in fact being more aggressive.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.991
Let's go now to Clarissa ward

00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:15.861
who is in Ukraine for us in

00:00:15.928 --> 00:00:16.795
Kyiv.

00:00:16.929 --> 00:00:18.263
Obviously this speech was had

00:00:18.397 --> 00:00:20.132
and I'm sure it was being

00:00:20.265 --> 00:00:22.101
watched by the leadership there

00:00:22.234 --> 00:00:22.601
in Ukraine.

00:00:22.735 --> 00:00:27.039
What are you hearing from them?

00:00:27.172 --> 00:00:28.507
&gt;&gt; Reporter: We've only heard

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:29.875
reaction from one senior adviser

00:00:30.008 --> 00:00:33.178
to the presidency, but I'm sure

00:00:33.312 --> 00:00:35.981
it reflects the general thinking

00:00:36.115 --> 00:00:37.216
in the leadership here.

00:00:37.349 --> 00:00:39.485
He said Putin demonstrated

00:00:39.885 --> 00:00:41.253
irrelevance and confusion

00:00:41.387 --> 00:00:44.123
because everywhere there are

00:00:44.256 --> 00:00:46.625
Nazis, martians and conspiracy

00:00:46.759 --> 00:00:46.992
theories.

00:00:47.126 --> 00:00:48.594
Really referring there to this

00:00:48.727 --> 00:00:50.396
kind of alternate reality that

00:00:50.529 --> 00:00:52.564
Putin appears to be presenting.

00:00:52.698 --> 00:00:55.100
He accused the Ukrainian

00:00:55.234 --> 00:00:57.136
government of being responsible

00:00:57.269 --> 00:00:59.171
for destroying the economy,

00:00:59.304 --> 00:01:01.140
destroying the lives of its

00:01:01.273 --> 00:01:01.507
citizens.

00:01:01.907 --> 00:01:02.741
He accused them of being

00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:04.042
responsible for starting the

00:01:04.176 --> 00:01:04.309
war.

00:01:04.443 --> 00:01:06.879
He accused them of paying more

00:01:07.012 --> 00:01:08.647
attention to the interests of

00:01:08.781 --> 00:01:10.649
the west than to the interests

00:01:10.783 --> 00:01:12.518
of their own Ukrainian people.

00:01:12.651 --> 00:01:16.755
Really reflecting a sort of

00:01:16.889 --> 00:01:18.590
startling take on the actual

00:01:18.724 --> 00:01:20.325
events that we have seen

00:01:20.459 --> 00:01:21.093
transpire on the ground in the

00:01:21.226 --> 00:01:21.927
last year.

00:01:22.027 --> 00:01:23.929
He said, quote, talking about

00:01:23.962 --> 00:01:25.230
the Ukrainian government again,

00:01:25.364 --> 00:01:28.934
they unleashed the war and we

00:01:29.067 --> 00:01:31.203
continue to use force to stop

00:01:31.336 --> 00:01:31.470
it.

00:01:31.603 --> 00:01:33.238
This kind of thinking, this sort

00:01:33.372 --> 00:01:36.842
of alternative reality,

00:01:36.975 --> 00:01:38.710
I think

00:01:38.844 --> 00:01:39.411
really underscores why it is

00:01:39.545 --> 00:01:41.246
that the Ukrainian government

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:43.382
has shown such reluctance to sit

00:01:43.515 --> 00:01:45.517
down at the negotiating table

00:01:45.951 --> 00:01:48.187
with Vladimir Putin or with his

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:49.955
emissaries and try to hash out

00:01:49.955 --> 00:01:51.023
some kind of a political

00:01:51.156 --> 00:01:51.390
situation.

00:01:51.523 --> 00:01:52.825
Because at this stage, it is

00:01:52.958 --> 00:01:54.460
clear that there is such a

00:01:54.593 --> 00:01:56.128
discrepancy in understanding and

00:01:56.261 --> 00:01:57.596
perspective on the war, and

00:01:57.963 --> 00:02:00.532
there is such a complete lack of

00:02:00.666 --> 00:02:02.768
respect for truth and for facts

00:02:02.901 --> 00:02:08.106
that the Ukrainians just don't

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:08.841
believe there is any prospect of

00:02:08.974 --> 00:02:10.142
being able to take Russia at its

00:02:10.275 --> 00:02:17.549
word even if it were to offer a

00:02:17.983 --> 00:02:21.286
moreciliatory approach.

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:22.821
But I do think it is fair to say

00:02:22.955 --> 00:02:23.989
that the leadership will be

00:02:23.989 --> 00:02:25.157
offering this as classic

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:26.758
evidence for why a political

00:02:26.892 --> 00:02:28.060
solution is just not feasible at

00:02:28.193 --> 00:02:28.594
the moment.

00:02:28.727 --> 00:02:31.296
&gt;&gt; And that is the problem with

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:32.097
lies.

00:02:32.231 --> 00:02:35.367
Clarissa, thank you so much.

00:02:35.501 --> 00:02:37.236
When you hear stuff like that

00:02:37.369 --> 00:02:39.438
from Putin, you can see why the

00:02:39.571 --> 00:02:44.009
Ukrainians say he's not dealing

00:02:44.009 --> 00:02:46.211
in reality.

00:02:46.345 --> 00:02:49.314
&gt;&gt; Yeah, and it was a lengthy

00:02:49.448 --> 00:02:51.116
speech from Putin.

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:52.251
President Biden was likely not

00:02:52.384 --> 00:02:55.521
watching it, but he will be

00:02:55.654 --> 00:02:56.021
updated.

00:02:56.021 --> 00:02:59.224
Let's bring in David Sanger,

00:02:59.358 --> 00:03:00.058
correspondent for the "New York

00:03:00.192 --> 00:03:00.392
Times."

00:03:00.526 --> 00:03:01.393
So good to have you here in

00:03:01.527 --> 00:03:03.662
Poland with us.

00:03:04.029 --> 00:03:04.363
You were listening to Putin's

00:03:04.496 --> 00:03:05.197
speech as I was and you heard

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:06.999
him saying that they are

00:03:07.132 --> 00:03:08.100
suspending participation in that

00:03:08.233 --> 00:03:09.601
nuclear arms treaty.

00:03:10.035 --> 00:03:11.637
What does that say to you?

00:03:12.037 --> 00:03:13.639
&gt;&gt; What a remarkable two days to

00:03:14.039 --> 00:03:16.041
have the president in Kyiv

00:03:16.074 --> 00:03:19.411
yesterday, here today, and here

00:03:19.545 --> 00:03:20.445
Vladimir Putin a year into this

00:03:20.579 --> 00:03:22.414
with a narrative that still is

00:03:22.548 --> 00:03:25.050
living in sort of his own head

00:03:25.183 --> 00:03:25.350
here.

00:03:25.484 --> 00:03:27.319
As Jake Sullivan, national

00:03:27.452 --> 00:03:30.255
security adviser, put it to us

00:03:30.389 --> 00:03:32.291
earlier today, if the Russians

00:03:32.424 --> 00:03:34.059
pulled out of the war today, the

00:03:34.059 --> 00:03:34.626
war would stop.

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:36.595
If the Ukrainians pulled out of

00:03:36.728 --> 00:03:38.797
the war today, Ukraine would

00:03:38.931 --> 00:03:40.165
just be absorbed into Russia.

00:03:40.299 --> 00:03:42.467
&gt;&gt; Pushing back on what Putin

00:03:42.601 --> 00:03:43.569
has said that this is because of

00:03:43.702 --> 00:03:44.236
the west.

00:03:44.369 --> 00:03:46.305
&gt;&gt; That's right, that somehow

00:03:46.438 --> 00:03:50.542
the west threatened it.

00:03:50.676 --> 00:03:53.478
And new S.T.A.R.T. Is the last

00:03:53.612 --> 00:03:55.614
remaining arms control treaty

00:03:55.747 --> 00:03:56.648
between the United States and

00:03:56.782 --> 00:03:56.982
Russia.

00:03:57.115 --> 00:03:58.584
It covers the biggest weapons,

00:03:58.717 --> 00:04:00.152
the strategic weapons that go

00:04:00.285 --> 00:04:02.321
on, icbms that could it will the

00:04:02.454 --> 00:04:03.522
United States or other

00:04:03.655 --> 00:04:06.091
countries, or it could hit

00:04:06.158 --> 00:04:06.358
Russia.

00:04:06.491 --> 00:04:08.093
And under that treaty, both

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:09.728
sides are supposed to be able to

00:04:10.095 --> 00:04:10.929
inspect the other to make sure

00:04:11.063 --> 00:04:14.166
that they are complying with the

00:04:14.299 --> 00:04:15.367
number of warheads that they

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:17.002
could have, the deployment of

00:04:17.135 --> 00:04:19.371
extra strategic missiles and so

00:04:19.504 --> 00:04:19.671
forth.

00:04:20.105 --> 00:04:21.440
Those inspections haven't

00:04:21.573 --> 00:04:23.575
happened in the past few years.

00:04:23.709 --> 00:04:24.943
First because of covid, and then

00:04:25.077 --> 00:04:26.578
because the Russians would not

00:04:26.712 --> 00:04:28.380
allow the inspectors back in.

00:04:28.513 --> 00:04:30.716
What he has done now has said

00:04:30.849 --> 00:04:32.184
I'm done with participating in

00:04:32.317 --> 00:04:33.585
this inspection thing.

00:04:33.719 --> 00:04:35.721
What he didn't say was that he

00:04:36.121 --> 00:04:38.557
is going to build more weapons

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:40.826
beyond the 1550 that are

00:04:40.959 --> 00:04:41.193
allowed.

00:04:41.326 --> 00:04:44.296
Now, the whole treaty expires in

00:04:44.429 --> 00:04:44.930
early 2026.

00:04:45.063 --> 00:04:48.133
And one of the big questions is,

00:04:48.133 --> 00:04:49.034
is this a Vladimir Putin who is

00:04:49.167 --> 00:04:50.902
even interested in having a

00:04:51.036 --> 00:04:54.139
follow-on treaty.

00:04:54.139 --> 00:04:56.675
&gt;&gt; David, you wrote last night

00:04:56.808 --> 00:04:57.809
that these vastly different

00:04:58.143 --> 00:04:59.444
world views that we're seeing on

00:04:59.578 --> 00:05:00.679
the world stage today between

00:05:00.812 --> 00:05:02.147
what Putin just said and what

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:09.221
the president will say shows,

00:05:09.354 --> 00:05:11.623
quote, echos of what president

00:05:11.757 --> 00:05:14.159
Biden wanted to replay.

00:05:14.159 --> 00:05:14.993
The difference of course is the

00:05:15.127 --> 00:05:19.531
China factor, right?

00:05:19.665 --> 00:05:21.133
&gt;&gt; That's right.

00:05:21.266 --> 00:05:22.968
The China factor is a big

00:05:23.101 --> 00:05:25.170
element to this because in the

00:05:25.303 --> 00:05:28.807
cold war, it was basically

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:30.175
between the United States and

00:05:30.175 --> 00:05:31.710
the soviet union.

00:05:31.843 --> 00:05:34.279
Now we have a much larger third

00:05:34.413 --> 00:05:34.613
player.

00:05:34.746 --> 00:05:36.982
And that makes this a lot more

00:05:37.115 --> 00:05:37.382
complicated.

00:05:37.516 --> 00:05:39.751
It is also a player on whom we

00:05:40.185 --> 00:05:41.186
are dependent for technology,

00:05:41.319 --> 00:05:45.057
for a lot of trade.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.492
We were never in the cold war

00:05:47.626 --> 00:05:48.827
dependent on the soviet union

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:50.929
for key technologies.

00:05:51.063 --> 00:05:52.564
Every apple iPhone that you pick

00:05:52.698 --> 00:05:54.199
up is made -- or just about

00:05:54.299 --> 00:05:56.201
every one -- is made in China.

00:05:56.334 --> 00:05:57.135
Think about that.

00:05:57.269 --> 00:05:58.804
Almost everything that you see

00:05:58.937 --> 00:06:01.039
at Walmart or much of what you

00:06:01.173 --> 00:06:02.207
see is made in China.

00:06:02.307 --> 00:06:04.743
And so this is a much more

00:06:04.876 --> 00:06:06.344
complicated dynamic.

00:06:06.478 --> 00:06:08.213
And that is why it is

00:06:08.213 --> 00:06:09.314
particularly important that

00:06:09.448 --> 00:06:11.550
we're seeing the top foreign

00:06:11.683 --> 00:06:15.220
affairs official in China in

00:06:15.353 --> 00:06:17.022
Moscow today meeting we think

00:06:17.155 --> 00:06:18.223
with president Putin, certainly

00:06:18.323 --> 00:06:19.558
with other Russian officials,

00:06:19.691 --> 00:06:21.259
while the president is here

00:06:21.393 --> 00:06:22.527
giving his speech.

00:06:22.661 --> 00:06:25.731
&gt;&gt; And it was notable that just

00:06:25.864 --> 00:06:26.431
yesterday president zelenskyy

00:06:26.565 --> 00:06:28.233
told a German newspaper

00:06:28.366 --> 00:06:29.501
essentially if China does

00:06:29.634 --> 00:06:32.637
provide lethal aid to Russia,

00:06:32.771 --> 00:06:34.239
we'll have a World War.

00:06:34.272 --> 00:06:35.440
&gt;&gt; And that has been the big

00:06:35.574 --> 00:06:36.408
concern here because we're

00:06:36.541 --> 00:06:39.444
talking about nuclear powers now

00:06:39.578 --> 00:06:40.245
and World War.

00:06:40.345 --> 00:06:44.549
I to do want to ask you, David,

00:06:44.683 --> 00:06:47.753
you talked about the importance

00:06:47.886 --> 00:06:50.255
of China and where Russia stands

00:06:50.322 --> 00:06:51.556
and we're all connected whether

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:52.891
we like it or not.

00:06:53.024 --> 00:06:54.259
I'm wondering about what you

00:06:54.359 --> 00:06:57.896
think the possibilities are for

00:06:58.263 --> 00:06:59.498
Ukraine, assuming let's say that

00:06:59.631 --> 00:07:02.267
Ukraine ends up keeping its

00:07:02.267 --> 00:07:03.635
territory, can they join the eu,

00:07:03.769 --> 00:07:05.170
will they be given a position

00:07:05.303 --> 00:07:06.271
for example in nato?

00:07:06.304 --> 00:07:07.839
Do you think that that is a

00:07:08.273 --> 00:07:09.841
possibility after all that has

00:07:10.275 --> 00:07:14.279
happened now in this scenario?

00:07:14.279 --> 00:07:16.515
&gt;&gt; There is a big argument about

00:07:16.648 --> 00:07:18.450
whether this would be a wise

00:07:18.583 --> 00:07:20.886
time to let Ukraine into nato or

00:07:21.019 --> 00:07:21.153
not.

00:07:21.286 --> 00:07:23.722
Think about this, Ukraine is at

00:07:23.855 --> 00:07:24.289
war.

00:07:24.289 --> 00:07:27.692
If it became a member of nato

00:07:27.826 --> 00:07:29.561
tomorrow, nato would be obliged

00:07:29.694 --> 00:07:33.131
to enter that war directly.

00:07:33.265 --> 00:07:34.299
So far it has been indirect.

00:07:34.399 --> 00:07:35.634
The United States, nato

00:07:35.767 --> 00:07:36.868
countries have been providing

00:07:37.002 --> 00:07:38.303
arms, they have been providing

00:07:38.336 --> 00:07:39.571
intelligence, but they haven't

00:07:39.704 --> 00:07:43.008
been providing actual human

00:07:43.141 --> 00:07:43.341
forces.

00:07:43.475 --> 00:07:44.442
And president Biden has made it

00:07:44.576 --> 00:07:46.311
pretty clear that while he wants

00:07:46.411 --> 00:07:47.813
to support Ukraine, he does not

00:07:47.946 --> 00:07:50.148
want to risk World War III as he

00:07:50.315 --> 00:07:51.950
puts it to his staff and that

00:07:52.317 --> 00:07:53.618
means no direct conflict with

00:07:53.752 --> 00:07:54.920
the Russians.

00:07:55.053 --> 00:07:57.622
That would end if they entered

00:07:57.756 --> 00:07:57.989
nato.

